     ▼
    L001_97_Artifacts


6 - Files
    -----

    L001_00_Premises.v

      Generic closure, decision, evaluation-frame, regulator-adapter,
      refutation, and double-negation vocabulary.

    L001_01__Aporetic_Lemma.v

      Fixed-point construction, branch collapse, and the M001 specialization
      `aporetic_lemma`.

    L001_02__Aporetic_Obstruction.v

      Generic and regulator obstruction theorems, status branches, and the
      refutation-only non-collapse witness.

    L001_95_API.v

      Public closure aliases, named contract propositions, and
      contradiction-shaped API endpoints.

    L001_97_Artifacts.v

      Certified contract endpoints and assumption-report hooks for
      `certified_aporetic_lemma_contract` and `aporetic_lemma_qed`.

    _appendix/_assumptions/

      Redirect target for the L001 assumption reports.


